      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03087",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“真怪啊，要超时了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "How strange, he is about to run out of time.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03087",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "连这样有才能的人也用完四十个小时，实在令人吃惊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is truly astonishing that even someone this talented has used up all forty hours.",
          "g": "predicate"
