    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03087",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "是白白浪费时间吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Is he simply wasting time for nothing?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03087",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "本来一分钟能下这一手，可是……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He should have been able to make this move in one minute, and yet...",
          "g": "predicate"
